SYMATTR InstName U1
TEXT 24 96 Left 2 ;* Moving average with .measure command (result in 100 runs)\n.param t=0\n.step param t  10m 990m 10m\n.param S=10m\n.meas TRAN Moving_Average AVG (v(out)) TRIG time=t-S/2 TARG time=t+S/2\n* open error.log and right click on the resulting table values to plot it
TEXT 24 160 Left 2 !.tran 0 10 1 0.1m uic
TEXT 24 216 Left 2 !.subckt AVG1  in out params: fc=3 b0=1 b1=3 \nC1 1 0 {.5/pi/fc}\nC2 out 0 {.5/pi/fc}\nG1 0 1 VALUE = {(v(IN)-v(OUT))*{b0/b1}} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\nG2 out 0 1 out {-b1} \n* To prevent floating nodes\nRout out 0 1e12\nR1 1 0 1e12\n.ends RMS
TEXT 24 192 Left 2 !x1 in out AVG1 params: fc=10 b0=1 b1=3
TEXT 24 80 Left 2 !.param tdv=1 tdt=1
TEXT 80 -48 Left 2 ;NOTE: For avg it is necessary to disable \noperating point computation at startup of\nsimulation (UIC flag)
TEXT 88 8 Left 2 ;use different fc paramaeter values\nfc=0.1 or fc=10
